R0/ and R1/ are derived from EnterpriseRAG-Bench's generated_data/
(https://github.com/onyx-dot-app/EnterpriseRAG-Bench, commit d36685e273713975ee20299bbf1ab64165575b3c),
split into a starting release (R0) and an added release (R1). Records under sources/ omit the generator
fields dataset_doc_uuid, title_field_name, content_field_names, original_location, and
dataset_noise_document.

