edited for this task: the support-process, console, pricing, status-page, charter and decoy records cited
in tests/data/provenance.json (for example support-console-billing-credits-and-disputes-v2.json,
support-console-credit-ledger-2027.json, support-charter-2027.json, support-refund-authority-proposal.json,
